# --- USGR probe-pose (standard-view) guidance (optional) ---
# Provide all three to enable translation + view-conditioned guidance.
# If any is unset/missing the app runs rotation-only.
#   PROBE_POSE_WEIGHTS:      EMA transformer-head checkpoint (e.g. ema_9000.pth)
#   PROBE_POSE_NORM_STATS:   pose Normalizer stats (normalization_statistics.pth)
#   PROBE_POSE_DINO_WEIGHTS: frozen DINOv3 ConvNeXt-Base pretrained weights
#                            (dinov3_convnext_base_pretrain_lvd1689m-801f2ba9.pth)
PROBE_POSE_WEIGHTS=/Users/jileihao/dev/paradigm/cardiac-ultrasound-guidance/weights/ema_9000.pth
PROBE_POSE_NORM_STATS=/Users/jileihao/dev/paradigm/cardiac-ultrasound-guidance/weights/normalization_statistics.pth
